783
00:51:40,263 --> 00:51:42,293
He's the fuckin'
governor--

784
00:51:42,340 --> 00:51:43,796
Edwin Tuttle.

785
00:51:44,060 --> 00:51:45,780
They're first cousins.

786
00:51:46,544 --> 00:51:47,891
Well, that makes sense.

787
00:51:47,891 --> 00:51:49,923
Yeah, that's the
sound of The Big Machine,

788
00:51:49,923 --> 00:51:52,787
Cohle, that's gearing up
